            ],
            "kind": "primitive",
            "props": {
              "size": "LETTER",
              "style": {
                "backgroundColor": "#FFFFFF",
                "color": "#1A1A1A",
                "fontFamily": "Manrope",
                "fontSize": 10.5,
                "padding": 54,
                "paddingBottom": 50,
              },
            },
            "tag": "PAGE",
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "METHODOLOGY",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#EA2C00",
                        "fontSize": 9,
                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                        "letterSpacing": 2,
                        "marginBottom": 8,
                        "textTransform": "uppercase",
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "How these numbers were built",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#1A1A1A",
                        "fontSize": 18,
                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                        "marginBottom": 6,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Quadrant structure",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#1A1A1A",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                        "marginBottom": 4,
                        "marginTop": 8,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Value is organized into four ROI quadrants: Capacity, Workforce, Revenue, and Quality. Each quadrant reflects how Abridge's documentation efficiency translates into operational and financial outcomes. Some drivers carry quantified financial models; others are qualitative outcomes tracked post-deployment.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#666666",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "lineHeight": 1.5,
                        "marginBottom": 12,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Time-savings scenarios",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#1A1A1A",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                        "marginBottom": 4,
                        "marginTop": 8,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Time savings are modeled across three scenarios — Conservative, Typical, and Optimistic — based on the minutes saved per encounter you provided. The ",
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "typical",
                      },
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": " scenario was used for this model.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#666666",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "lineHeight": 1.5,
                        "marginBottom": 12,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Year-over-year growth",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#1A1A1A",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                        "marginBottom": 4,
                        "marginTop": 8,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Annual recurring value is projected forward using growth rates you configured (Year 2 default 10%, Year 3 default 10%). For per-encounter pricing, encounter volume scales by the same percentages, so investment grows alongside value. For per-provider and annual-fee pricing, investment is held constant across all three years.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#666666",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "lineHeight": 1.5,
                        "marginBottom": 12,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Realization & confidence",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#1A1A1A",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "fontWeight": "bold",
                        "marginBottom": 4,
                        "marginTop": 8,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Each driver applies a realization rate that haircuts the gross modeled value to reflect operational adoption, billing capture, and partner-specific factors. Validate against historical performance data when available.",
                      },
                    ],
                    "kind": "primitive",
                    "props": {
                      "style": {
                        "color": "#666666",
                        "fontSize": 10.5,
                        "lineHeight": 1.5,
                        "marginBottom": 12,
                      },
                    },
                    "tag": "TEXT",
                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
